## R3
Primary P2 basket: EURUSD.DWX, GBPUSD.DWX, USDJPY.DWX, XAUUSD, GER40.DWX, NDX.DWX, WS30.DWX.

If this is later tested primarily on SP500.DWX, live promotion T6 gate: SP500.DWX is not broker-routable. If the EA passes P0-P9 on SP500.DWX only, T6 deploy requires a parallel-validation on NDX.DWX or WS30.DWX before AutoTrading enable.

## Author Claims
- Source says the strategy combines RSI and moving-average indicators.
- Source says a long position is opened when the RSI crosses the MA from top to bottom.
- Source says a short position is opened when RSI crosses the MA from bottom to top.

## Parameters To Test
- Timeframe: M30, H1, H4.
- RSI length: 7, 14, 21.
- RSI MA length: 5, 9, 14.
- Reverse trade: off/on.
- Higher/lower resolution input: chart timeframe, H4.
- Safety stop: 1.5, 2.0, 3.0 ATR.
- Time stop: off, 24 bars, 48 bars.

## Initial Risk Profile
Oscillator crossover can overtrade in choppy markets. Keep pivot and reverse modes separate from the P2 baseline.

